    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but turning them back up feels impossible. i've tried. everything just feels so empty. like there's no point in fighting to stay bright when the house is already empty. it would just be easier if i could just... turn the last light off myself. before the dark gets too heavy to carry.",
